#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise sheet "
msgstr "練習單 "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise3.adoc:5
msgid "In this exercise you will complete a search on GBIF.org to evaluate the quality of the resulting data available for download."
msgstr "在此練習中，您將透過 GBIF.org 進行搜尋，以評估可下載之搜尋結果資料的品質。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise3.adoc:9
msgid "xref:attachment$Ex3-data-quality.docx[Download Exercise 3] (MS Word 158 KB)"
msgstr "xref:attachment$Ex3-data-quality.docx[下載練習題 3] (MS Word 158 KB)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise3.adoc:13
msgid "Search for Apidae occurrences present in Thailand with coordinates above 900 meters."
msgstr "搜尋位於海拔 900 公尺以上、座標位於泰國境內的蜜蜂科（Apidae）出現紀錄資料。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise3.adoc:14
msgid "How many occurrences are in the results?"
msgstr "結果中共有多少個出現紀錄資料？"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise3.adoc:15
msgid "View the Metrics tab and review the occurrence issues and flags."
msgstr "請查看「指標」分頁，並檢視出現紀錄資料的問題與警示。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise3.adoc:16
msgid "View the Download tab and review the known issues."
msgstr "請查看「下載」分頁，並檢視已知問題。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise3.adoc:17
msgid "Would any of the issues cause you to do further filtering before downloading the data?"
msgstr "上述問題中，是否有任何一項會讓您在下載資料前，再執行進一步的篩選？"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise3.adoc:17
msgid "Which issues would be important for you to resolve after downloading the data?"
msgstr "下載資料後，您認為哪些問題需要優先解決？"

